Package: MeDL
Type: Package
Title: Summary-Statistics-Based Tests for Genetically Predicted Mediators
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person("Meiling", "Liu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                    email = "rksyouyou@users.noreply.github.com"),
             person("Chongzhi", "Di", role = "aut"),
             person("Wei", "Sun", role = "aut"),
             person("Qianchuan", "He", role = "aut"),
             person("Li", "Hsu", role = "aut"))
Description: Reconstruct joint genetic effects from marginal association
    statistics and a reference genotype covariance matrix. Test the association
    of a genetically predicted mediator with an outcome using random-effects
    regression, allowing for correlated variants and a nonzero mean direct
    effect. Provides likelihood- and moment-based tests and an optional
    parametric bootstrap.
